{"2178070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Towers of Aghasba", "steam_appid": 2178070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after the Shimu people were forced to flee their homeland due to the invasion of a mysterious force known as the Withered, the Shimu have returned to reclaim their rightful home: the fantastical island of AGHASBA. As junior architect, it’s your job to rebuild the villages of your once-mighty civilization as well as nurse Aghasba’s once-thriving ecosystems back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE ISLAND OF AGHASBA<br>Traverse varied terrain, scale colossal mountains and gaze out upon jaw-dropping vistas, all brought to life in a vibrant, high-fidelity art style. Befriend strange and memorable creatures, learn the storied history of the Shimu people and uncover the dark origins of the Withered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REBUILD THE SHIMU CIVILIZATION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build sprawling settlements and watch them come alive as they’re inhabited by members of the Shimu tribe. Lose yourself in a rich creative sandbox as you decorate and construct your villages in a way that’s uniquely <i>you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RESTORE AGHASBA’S ECOSYSTEMS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore life to a devastated land by nurturing the growth of beautifully bizarre ecosystems. Grow plant life, attract &amp; feed animals, and work with the gods of Aghasba to revitalize the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRAVE THE WITHERED LANDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much of Aghasba is still infested with the Withered, a dark force that absorbs the life from all it touches. Craft weapons, armor and elixirs before venturing into the Withered Lands and battle bloodthirsty Withered monsters, gradually ridding the island of the Withered plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/543c9ec85306ed169249d155ca154e8c.webp?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Travel across a diverse, living landscape!</i><br>Climb epic mountains and glide across grand valleys in a beautiful open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/8f59ab3c89c97d61aaabf13ba981a4e5.poster.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/8f59ab3c89c97d61aaabf13ba981a4e5.webm?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/8f59ab3c89c97d61aaabf13ba981a4e5.mp4?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Construct sprawling villages!</i><br>Plan and build towns however you'd like, then express yourself with decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/f6e3579a28ead5e85dda356495d4bd35.poster.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/f6e3579a28ead5e85dda356495d4bd35.webm?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/f6e3579a28ead5e85dda356495d4bd35.mp4?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nurture a fertile land back to life!</i><br>Oversee the growth of ecosystems full of wonderfully bizarre flora and fauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/3fd6e3f16a5fb9dc3f9201aa0da75897.poster.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/3fd6e3f16a5fb9dc3f9201aa0da75897.webm?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/3fd6e3f16a5fb9dc3f9201aa0da75897.mp4?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience Aghasba with your friends!</i> <br>Go explore, build, decorate, collect items, or simply show off your island in a co-op multiplayer experience  with up to 4 players total.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/543c9ec85306ed169249d155ca154e8c.webp?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES OF MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, and together, breathe life back into Aghasba! Each player has a unique island, their own personal world to decorate, cultivate thriving ecosystems, and restore from the blight of the Withered. In co-op multiplayer, players can team up to breathe new life into each other’s islands. <br><i></i><br><i>Please note that multiplayer is currently in a prototype stage.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Gameplay:</strong> Join forces with up to three friends (4 total, including the host) to explore and revitalize the island. Engage in activities such as decorating, building, combating the Withered, planting diverse ecosystems, and gathering resources.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ToA MP focuses solely on cooperative play, with no player-versus-player elements.</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Islands:</strong> Every player maintains their own distinct island, reflecting their creative vision and efforts in healing the land. While islands remain individual and do not transfer between players, the collaborative experience allows for shared exploration and mutual assistance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Progress:</strong> Items and amity acquired during multiplayer sessions seamlessly transfer back to your personal island. This ensures that cooperative endeavors contribute meaningfully to your individual progress and development.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quest Progression in Co-op is currently available in a beta state. Note that any quest and story progression experienced in multiplayer is only applied to the host and does not carry over to other players in their own worlds.</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/4a87e57d30ee7e265396c2bdec57fca6.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=87 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after the Shimu people were forced to flee their homeland due to the invasion of a mysterious force known as the Withered, the Shimu have returned to reclaim their rightful home: the fantastical island of AGHASBA. As junior architect, it’s your job to rebuild the villages of your once-mighty civilization as well as nurse Aghasba’s once-thriving ecosystems back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE ISLAND OF AGHASBA<br>Traverse varied terrain, scale colossal mountains and gaze out upon jaw-dropping vistas, all brought to life in a vibrant, high-fidelity art style. Befriend strange and memorable creatures, learn the storied history of the Shimu people and uncover the dark origins of the Withered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REBUILD THE SHIMU CIVILIZATION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build sprawling settlements and watch them come alive as they’re inhabited by members of the Shimu tribe. Lose yourself in a rich creative sandbox as you decorate and construct your villages in a way that’s uniquely <i>you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RESTORE AGHASBA’S ECOSYSTEMS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore life to a devastated land by nurturing the growth of beautifully bizarre ecosystems. Grow plant life, attract &amp; feed animals, and work with the gods of Aghasba to revitalize the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRAVE THE WITHERED LANDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much of Aghasba is still infested with the Withered, a dark force that absorbs the life from all it touches. Craft weapons, armor and elixirs before venturing into the Withered Lands and battle bloodthirsty Withered monsters, gradually ridding the island of the Withered plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/543c9ec85306ed169249d155ca154e8c.webp?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Travel across a diverse, living landscape!</i><br>Climb epic mountains and glide across grand valleys in a beautiful open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/8f59ab3c89c97d61aaabf13ba981a4e5.poster.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/8f59ab3c89c97d61aaabf13ba981a4e5.webm?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/8f59ab3c89c97d61aaabf13ba981a4e5.mp4?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Construct sprawling villages!</i><br>Plan and build towns however you'd like, then express yourself with decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/f6e3579a28ead5e85dda356495d4bd35.poster.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/f6e3579a28ead5e85dda356495d4bd35.webm?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/f6e3579a28ead5e85dda356495d4bd35.mp4?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nurture a fertile land back to life!</i><br>Oversee the growth of ecosystems full of wonderfully bizarre flora and fauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/3fd6e3f16a5fb9dc3f9201aa0da75897.poster.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/3fd6e3f16a5fb9dc3f9201aa0da75897.webm?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/3fd6e3f16a5fb9dc3f9201aa0da75897.mp4?t=1759773354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience Aghasba with your friends!</i> <br>Go explore, build, decorate, collect items, or simply show off your island in a co-op multiplayer experience  with up to 4 players total.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/543c9ec85306ed169249d155ca154e8c.webp?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES OF MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, and together, breathe life back into Aghasba! Each player has a unique island, their own personal world to decorate, cultivate thriving ecosystems, and restore from the blight of the Withered. In co-op multiplayer, players can team up to breathe new life into each other’s islands. <br><i></i><br><i>Please note that multiplayer is currently in a prototype stage.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Gameplay:</strong> Join forces with up to three friends (4 total, including the host) to explore and revitalize the island. Engage in activities such as decorating, building, combating the Withered, planting diverse ecosystems, and gathering resources.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ToA MP focuses solely on cooperative play, with no player-versus-player elements.</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Islands:</strong> Every player maintains their own distinct island, reflecting their creative vision and efforts in healing the land. While islands remain individual and do not transfer between players, the collaborative experience allows for shared exploration and mutual assistance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Progress:</strong> Items and amity acquired during multiplayer sessions seamlessly transfer back to your personal island. This ensures that cooperative endeavors contribute meaningfully to your individual progress and development.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quest Progression in Co-op is currently available in a beta state. Note that any quest and story progression experienced in multiplayer is only applied to the host and does not carry over to other players in their own worlds.</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/extras/4a87e57d30ee7e265396c2bdec57fca6.avif?t=1759773354\" width=600 height=87 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore a stunning open-world filled with majestic creatures and quirky characters. Nurture the barren land into vibrant ecosystems and flex your creativity as you build a thriving civilization in balance with nature.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/3bf3bae70cfc34c8f964232f58a86ccc6a6fd902/header.jpg?t=1759773354", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/f03e4a814c3e35166f44a1a6d2deb671d36ee932/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759773354", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178070/f03e4a814c3e35166f44a1a6d2deb671d36ee932/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759773354", "website": "https://www.dreamlit.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon 